---
import Wordmark from '@/components/wordmark.astro'
import { SPEC_STATUS } from '@/lib/spec'
---

<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-line">
	<div class="shell flex flex-col gap-8 py-10 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between">
		<div class="max-w-sm">
			<Wordmark class="text-[0.95rem]" />
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-soft">
				An open identity and data layer for every physical product.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-3 text-xs text-soft">{SPEC_STATUS}</p>
		</div>
		<nav aria-label="Footer" class="text-sm">
			<h2 class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-soft uppercase">Site</h2>
			<ul class="mt-3 grid gap-2">
				<li><a href="/spec" class="rounded-sm underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent hover:underline">Specification</a></li>
				<li><a href="/publish" class="rounded-sm underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent hover:underline">Publish your products</a></li>
				<li>
					<a href="/spec/schemas/org.prodid.item.json" class="rounded-sm font-mono text-[0.8125rem] underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent hover:underline">
						org.prodid.item.json
					</a>
				</li>
				<li>
					<a href="/spec/schemas/org.prodid.feed.json" class="rounded-sm font-mono text-[0.8125rem] underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent hover:underline">
						org.prodid.feed.json
					</a>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</nav>
	</div>
	<div class="shell border-t border-line py-6">
		<p class="max-w-3xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-soft">
			The specification and the schemas are <abbr title="Creative Commons Zero">CC0</abbr>, and so are the{' '}
			<code class="font-mono">opid</code>s and the identifier mappings prodid.org publishes. Every other claim carries the
			licence of the source that made it. The reference implementation is Apache-2.0.
		</p>
	</div>
</footer>
